                    <hi rendition="#italic">Post</hi>, <ref target="#pg899">p. 899</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d382-f2" n="3" xml:id="d382-f2-content">
                <p>Anthony Eden, British Secretary of State for Foreign Affairs, was on a visit to
                    Moscow.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
